format-tree
----
tree 0: root pk=1
  pk=1 level=3 state=Ready count=2
    pk=20 level=2 state=Ready count=6
      pk=14 level=1 state=Ready count=8
      pk=15 level=1 state=Ready count=6
      pk=16 level=1 state=Ready count=5
      pk=17 level=1 state=Ready count=5
      pk=18 level=1 state=Ready count=5
      pk=19 level=1 state=Ready count=5
    pk=21 level=2 state=Ready count=5
      pk=10 level=1 state=Ready count=5
      pk=12 level=1 state=Ready count=8
      pk=13 level=1 state=Ready count=7
      pk=22 level=1 state=Ready count=4
      pk=23 level=1 state=Ready count=6

recall k=5 samples=8
----
recall@5: 100.00% (samples=8, truncated=0)
